### jaehoon으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon",
  "password": "jaehoon1234"
}

### 내 알림 목록
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications

### 내 알림 목록 - 두 개씩
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications?limit=2

### seoyeon으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seoyeon",
  "password": "instagram1234"
}

### seoyeon이 jaehoon의 게시물 1에 좋아요
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/likes/me

### seoyeon이 좋아요 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/likes/me

### seoyeon이 jaehoon의 게시물 1에 댓글
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "여기 어디예요?"
}

### seoyeon이 jaehoon과 doyun을 멘션
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "@jaehoon @doyun 다음 주에 같이 가요"
}

### doyun으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "doyun",
  "password": "instagram1234"
}

### doyun이 jaehoon을 팔로우
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/jaehoon/followers/me

### doyun이 팔로우 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/jaehoon/followers/me
